Negative control for domain-template.test.ts.

Looks the template up in the layout record with no fallback, so the full
layout is no longer drawn for a template the page does not lay out: an empty
one, a template the organism draws itself, or a name no domain layout carries
draws no layout. No template still takes the full default, and the full
template still draws its own layout.

Intended RED (domain-template.test.ts, "domainTemplate"):
  draws the full layout for an empty template
  draws the full layout for the drawer template the organism draws itself
  draws the full layout for the widget template the organism draws itself
  draws the full layout for a template only other pages carry
  draws the full layout for a name no layout carries
Intended GREEN:
  draws the layout the full template carries
  draws the full layout for no template

diff --git a/apps/cart-nuxt/app/shell/modules/domain/shell.ts b/apps/cart-nuxt/app/shell/modules/domain/shell.ts
